			"notes": "# Trade Automat v1.0.0 — Initial Release 🎉\n\nFirst release of **Trade Automat** for Minecraft 26.2 (Fabric)!\n\n### ✨ What's New\n* 🤖 **Trade Automat**: Automate buying and selling items with smart drop handling when inventories are full.\n* 🛠️ **Engineering Terminal**: Custom crafting & item modification with full **Item Components** support (preserves durability, custom data, etc.).\n* 🔍 **JEI Integration**: View Engineering Terminal recipes directly inside JEI.\n\n### ⚙️ Requirements\n* **Minecraft**: `26.2`\n* **Fabric Loader**: `>= 0.19.5`\n* **Java**: `26`\n* **JEI** *(Optional, recommended)*"
